# tests/publish-stack, as an ENTRY: evaluating this directory yields the test's
# ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST: design/publish-stack.md's operation, run through llm-step's
# real tool loop with a scripted model. It runs on std/go, which std/caos-test
# grants the mock model key, so this test's ArgTree carries the `secret-hash`
# llm-step's admission names.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --bash-tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash-tool --publish-stack:@=DEEP-DEPS/publish-stack --llm-step:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-step --stub:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-stub --tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test-tool
